---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us — Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide"
  description="Contact the Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide team. Send us your questions, corrections, or volunteer stories. We typically respond within 2-3 days."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-600 uppercase mb-3">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-warm-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Get in Touch
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-warm-600 leading-relaxed">
      Have a question, correction, or a story from your own visit? We would love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-2">Email Us</h2>
        <p class="text-warm-600 mb-3">For general inquiries, corrections, or to share your panda volunteer story:</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-accent-600 transition-colors">
          hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-warm-500">We typically respond within 2-3 business days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-2">Share Your Experience</h2>
        <p class="text-warm-600">
          Volunteered at a panda base and want to share your story? We welcome guest contributions from past volunteers. Your first-hand experience helps other travelers plan their trips. Send us your story and photos, and we will feature it on our blog with full credit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-warm-200 bg-white">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-2">Report an Error</h2>
        <p class="text-warm-600">
          If you spot outdated information — ticket prices, opening hours, or anything else — please let us know. We take accuracy seriously and update our content regularly. Every page with time-sensitive info shows a "Last updated" date.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-accent-50 border border-accent-200">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-2">Important Note</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-warm-700 leading-relaxed">
          We are an <strong>independent travel guide</strong>. We are <strong>not affiliated</strong> with the official Dujiangyan Panda Base, the China Conservation and Research Center for the Giant Panda, or any government tourism organization. For official inquiries (volunteer bookings, visiting permits, official information), please contact the base directly through official channels listed on the China Conservation and Research Center for the Giant Panda website.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
